AMD GPU support (this fork)
---------------------------

The Metal backend for AMD GPUs on Intel Macs in this fork is ported from ToshLLM
(<https://github.com/engeldlgado/toshllm>):

    Copyright (C) 2026 Engelbert Delgado <engeldlgado@gmail.com>
    SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later

The changes that port makes, and the code it adds, cover 111 paths on top of upstream
1ab7e5ad2, including:

    ggml/     AMD Metal kernels (ToshGEMM, AMD attention, wave64 path), Metal
              device selection and multi-GPU collectives, CPU-side support
              (57 paths)
    src/      model and context hooks the AMD path needs (26 paths)
    tosh-moe/ optional bounded-VRAM MoE expert cache (4 paths)
    common/, tests/, tools/, include/, cmake/, CMakeLists.txt
    docs/, README.md, scripts/, bench-macos-amd.tsv

The complete list is `git diff --name-only 1ab7e5ad2 <revision>`.

